meta {
  name: list-drugs
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

get {
  url: {{baseURL}}/inventory/drugs/list
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

params:query {
  ~search: amoxicillin
  ~page: 1
  ~pageSize: 10
}

settings {
  encodeUrl: true
  timeout: 0
}

docs {
  # List Drugs

  Returns one page of the authenticated workspace's Drug Master, ordered by drug name.

  ## Authorization

  Requires an authenticated user with an active workspace membership.

  ## Query Parameters

  | Parameter | Type | Required | Description |
  |-----------|------|----------|-------------|
  | `search` | string | No | Case-insensitive partial match against brand name, generic name, strength, dosage form, or unit. |
  | `page` | integer | No | One-based page number. Defaults to `1`. |
  | `pageSize` | integer | No | Rows per page from `1` to `100`. Defaults to `10`. |

  ## Success Response

  **`200 OK`**

  ```json
  {
    "status": "success",
    "message": "Drugs fetched successfully",
    "data": {
      "drugs": [
        {
          "id": "drug-uuid",
          "name": "Amoxil",
          "genericName": "Amoxicillin",
          "strength": "500 mg",
          "form": "Capsule",
          "unit": "Pack",
          "isActive": true
        }
      ],
      "pagination": {
        "page": 1,
        "pageCount": 1,
        "pageSize": 10,
        "total": 1
      }
    }
  }
  ```

  ## Notes

  - Active and inactive drugs are returned; use `isActive` to distinguish them.
  - Search is scoped to the authenticated workspace.
  - An empty catalogue returns `drugs: []` and pagination totals of zero.

  ## Errors

  | Status | Description |
  |--------|-------------|
  | `401 Unauthorized` | Authentication is invalid or workspace access is suspended. |
  | `500 Internal Server Error` | Drug retrieval failed unexpectedly. |
}
